  m_Name: unit_840828
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  unitName: Sagacious Mantra Ukie
  unitId: 840828
  unitNumber: 8604
  description: "A celestial creature sent to the earthly realm in a test of talents
    to select the next trusted advisor to Emperor Yu, energetic and vivacious Monkey
    sought to carve her own legend in dramatic form.Part truth, part exaggeration,
    and all bombast, Ukie's first contact with her upright cousins was to accidentally
    clock two upside the head with a pair of borrowed tonfas and pounce on the third.
    It took a total time-out to stop their rehearsal from dissolving into a brawl,
    and amid some rather sheepish apologies, the troupe realized they had caught
    her antics on tape. It was then they saw the primal grace of a much-beloved cultural
    legend reenacted by this strange, impish girl who seemed to have appeared out
    of nowhere.To this day, the troupe still isn't sure if Ukie takes method acting
    to an extreme, but that hasn't done anything to deter them from welcoming their
    new leading role.As word of their exciting new addition spread, many flocked
    to the little town to catch a glimpse of Ukie's electrifying renditions of the
    Great Sage's many adventures. A born trickster, his mischievous exploits are
    well known across the land\u2014as many celestial beings as evil spirits had
    tasted the business end of the Great Sage's legendary staff.For the celestial
    monkey in Ukie, there was surely no better role. By acting out the mighty spirit
    of a beloved legend, she displayed not only her talents, but proved that the
    world of mankind was inextricably tied with that of the other realms. Perhaps
    only Emperor Yu knows if there truly was ever one such Great Sage\u2014otherwise
    known as the \"Monkey King\"..."
  summonDesc: "Witness me! <br>I, who have defied demons and triumphed over all evil!<br>I
    shall journey ever westward\u2014wait what? Not again..."
  fusionDesc: I'll take this one, that one, and...<br>...Look, I'm just really hungry,
    okay?<br>Yes. All the time!
  evoDesc: Ohh, I feel great!<br>Like I'm dancing on clouds and stuff!<br>That's
    not weird, is it?<br>
  element: 4
  rarity: 7
